# Known AI agent tools, read by ah-noaicheck (see ../README.md).
#
# One entry per line; blank lines and lines starting with '#' are ignored.
# An entry without a leading '.' is an executable name: a file, link or
# folder with that exact name in a binary or install folder, or a running
# process of that name, is a hit. An entry starting with '.' is a credential
# or config path relative to a home folder (components separated by '/'):
# its presence in any home or in /root is a hit.
#
# A renamed binary is not caught by name; the package allowlist and the
# egress filter cover that. The list needs upkeep as tools appear.

# Executable names.
claude
codex
opencode
gemini
amp
copilot
github-copilot-cli
crush
cursor-agent
grok
kilo
kilocode
kimi
qwen
aider
goose
continue
cn
cline
devin
kiro-cli
antigravity
agy
droid
llm
ollama

